# Scratch directories the four gates build and run in. test/_bounds also holds
# the generated over-bound inputs, and test/_elements and test/_refusals the
# generated probe driver and fixtures -- files the gates write rather than
# files anybody edits.
test/_work/
test/_bounds/
test/_elements/
test/_refusals/

# Compiler and run leftovers, wherever they land.
*.exe
*.o
*.mod
mobcal_he
mobcal_n2

# The program writes these to the current directory under fixed names.
hold
temp.out

# A user's working copy of one of the two shipped mobcal_He.in / mobcal_N2.in
# templates, and the outputs they name -- anchored to the root so the
# committed sample-output/ files of the same name are untouched.
/mobcal.in
/Choline_He.out
/Choline_N2.out
